# ============ 运行产物（不进仓库）============
_internal/.browser/
_internal/.session.json
_internal/logs/
_internal/output/
_internal/sweeps/

# ============ Danbooru 标签数据（随仓库附带快照，见 README「前置要求」）============
_internal/data/*
!_internal/data/tagsd_danbooru_zh.csv

# ============ 个人配置 / 提示词库 ============
_internal/config.json
_internal/dev/prompts/
_internal/dev/_preview/
_internal/dev/README.full.md
_internal/assets/

# ============ Python ============
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo

# ============ 编辑器 / 系统 ============
.vscode/
.idea/
*.tmp
Thumbs.db
Desktop.ini

# 快捷方式：绝对路径 + 本机信息，不进仓库（图标 TagSDanbooru.ico 是进仓库的）
*.lnk
